00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.540
and Asuruman was more than willing to help.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.620
Meanwhile, Koji was plagued by his deepest fears about friendship.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.600
Karatuman thought he got the best of him,

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.360
